## 3. Chain / Stack Defaults
Pick a low-fee EVM L2 for MVP (Base is a reasonable default if you already have Farcaster overlap).

Suggested tools:
- Contracts: Solidity + Foundry (preferred) or Hardhat
- Indexing: simple event listener using ethers.js
- Aggregator: Node.js service (Express or Fastify)
- Client wallet: wagmi + viem or ethers.js

