## 12. Definition of Done (MVP)
MVP is done when:
- Anyone can open the web demo, connect wallet, pay to vote.
- Cursor moves once per tick based on aggregated votes.
- Pot grows with votes.
- If no finalized move occurs for TIMEOUT, last mover can claim pot.
- All state transitions are anchored by onchain events.
- Repo has clear run instructions for local + testnet.

